Number streamed Vertex AI tool calls sequentially

Backport of https://github.com/ogx-ai/ogx/pull/6775
(fixes https://github.com/ogx-ai/ogx/issues/6774).

Gemini sends each function call whole, and the tool call positions restart
at 0 in every streamed chunk. When parallel function calls arrive in
separate chunks they all get index 0, and consumers merge them into a
single call whose arguments are concatenated (invalid) JSON. Assign
indices sequentially across the stream.

Drop this patch once llama-stack includes the upstream fix.

